Z||000000||BroCar 87||05-16-2000||09:19 PM||||As some of you know, I am in the process of painting my 87 coupe. Today I took off quite a few things and bought the "Satin Black" spray paint (the one with the fiero on it). I must say, it works damn good. I used it on my sail panels, grill inserts, grill hold downs,... and it looks great. When I get done with the painting, I will post some pics. They WILL look SWEET  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>p.s. The 5 dollars is worth the can of paint. (IT HAS A FIERO ON IT ! )||||reg||10
Z||000001||William||05-16-2000||10:34 PM||||I also used the stuff on the plastic molding down where the wiper arms attach. It's little stuff like that which will make your car look new again.<P>ps.. I cruised down cosmos today trying to get a peek at your coupe but never found gardenia rd<P>||||reg||1
