Z||000006||theogre||05-17-2000||11:42 PM||||The stuff with the fiero on the can is MarHyde I tink. It's in another thread.<P>Gloss black for what? The body? use regular car paint in a spray can. Wallmart etc. with all the touch up paint in the car area. Other things? car paint, Rustoleum or Krylon will all work. Krylon and Rusto both shine good on all sorts of stuff, even wood. (Used one or the other to paint the "candy cane swords" we use for Nut Cracker. Stuff really poped on stage. Best red we've ever had on them.[Yes I've seen the army men comercial. love it.])||||reg||1
